[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0018","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0018","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 域控制器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 Server、Advanced Server 和 Datacenter Server 中的域控制器存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标域控制器发送大量畸形服务请求，导致 LSASS 或其他关键服务崩溃，造成系统停止响应或重启。攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0018"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-07-21","updated":"2024-06-16","remediation":"安装微软安全公告 MS01-011 中提供的安全更新补丁。对于无法安装补丁的系统，建议在网络边界防火墙处限制对域控制器 TCP/UDP 135、139、445 端口的访问以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-011","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/82/148411","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-049.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6136"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0364","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1030","title":"Squid HTTP 加速器模式 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Squid 在 HTTP 加速模式（httpd_accel_host 配置）下，当 httpd_accel_host 与 http_accel_with_proxy 参数设为 off 时，未正确启用访问控制列表（ACL），导致攻击者可绕过 ACL 限制，对目标代理服务器执行未授权操作，如端口扫描等恶意活动。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.3STABLE5 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。攻击条件为攻击者需能访问目标 Squid 代理服务器的 HTTP 加速端口，无需身份认证即可触发。利用方式为向目标发送特制的 HTTP 请求，绕过 ACL 访问控制机制，实施未授权的网络探测或端口扫描活动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1030"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:26.713","remediation":"将 Squid 升级至 2.3STABLE5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTTP 加速器模式下 ACL 被绕过的问题。如暂无法升级，可在 squid.conf 中禁用 httpd_accel_host 和 http_accel_with_proxy off 组合配置，或直接关闭 HTTP 加速器模式，并手动确保 access control lists 始终生效作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0362.html","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-031-01","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-029.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-066.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-097.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/197727","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6862"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0364.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0401","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1279","title":"tcpdump 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-1279是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1279"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-17T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:57.353","remediation":"立即将 tcpdump 升级至 3.6_rel3 或更高版本（3.6.2 及更早版本受影响）；发行版用户可安装对应安全更新（如 Red Hat RHSA-2001:089、FreeBSD-SA-01:48、Mandrake MDKSA-2002:032、Caldera CSSA-2002-025）。临时缓解：在防火墙或抓包过滤中屏蔽 AFS Rx 相关 UDP 端口（7000–7009 等），或以 `tcpdump not udp port 7000 or 7001 or 7002 or 7003 or 7004 or 7005 or 7006 or 7007 or 7008 or 7009` 方式启动，避免解码恶意 AFS RPC 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000480","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7006.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/797201","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-032.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-089.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3065","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24762ffc4408618d0c62379d258b248e81056dc1/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1279","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1279.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8305d7f6f9031873a5609178b8b2d4422836eee7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-798q-jpvf-xqwg/GHSA-798q-jpvf-xqwg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1279.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a937cff2-4864-4b52-bef6-740361ba9345.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/fe4a6dac94ff18c50a8e258d658a3df5b1f21651/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0352","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0977","title":"OpenLDAP slapd 基础编码规则拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 的 slapd 守护进程在处理 LDAP 协议请求时，对 Basic Encoding Rules (BER) 格式数据的长度字段验证存在缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标 slapd 服务发送包含无效 BER 长度字段的特制数据包，触发服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 OpenLDAP 1.x 版本 1.2.12 之前以及 2.x 版本 2.0.8 之前的所有版本，导致目录服务拒绝服务。攻击者只需能够访问 slapd 监听的网络端口即可发起利用，无需任何用户凭证或交互，成功利用后将使 slapd 进程异常终止，造成目录服务不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0977"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:20.553","remediation":"将 OpenLDAP 升级至 2.0.8（2.x 分支）或 1.2.12（1.x 分支），并应用官方发布的安全补丁。如暂无法升级，可在防火墙层限制对 slapd 端口（默认为 389/tcp 和 636/tcp）的外部访问，仅允许可信来源连接，以缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000417","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-18.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-068","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/935800","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-069.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/1905","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-098.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3049","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1781cc6a314747dfce9d8864a3f090ef8f0a6f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0977.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0977","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/21f29c262df67f8fba785d468c4552b0e1fc4211/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0977.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qh43-w96h-9v7c/GHSA-qh43-w96h-9v7c.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/426b24561da5907e2706f7cda3b65ab75123f3ba/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0977.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-068.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0977.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f5037078-5dd7-4468-8ea9-63bbf7b32c22.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3752f6f525ece5f538643d4f66c1710bac6f959a/2001/CVE-2001-0977.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0389","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1269","title":"Info-ZIP UnZip 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Info-ZIP UnZip 软件 (5.42 及更早版本) 存在文件名处理不当漏洞，攻击者可通过构造以 '/' 斜线开头的文件名压缩包，利用软件提取机制中的路径验证缺陷，将恶意文件写入系统任意位置。此漏洞主要影响 Linux/Unix 环境下的 Unzip 用户，在未经身份验证的情况下即可远程利用。攻击条件包括：目标系统安装了受影响的 Unzip 版本，且用户解压了攻击者控制的恶意压缩文件。利用方式是攻击者精心设计 ZIP 归档文件，伪装成正常压缩包，其中文件名以 '/' 开头，Unzip 在提取时会将其视为绝对路径，直接覆盖系统关键文件，导致权限提升或系统破坏。此漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，威胁等级较低，但可能导致严重的权限提升风险。Info-ZIP 团队已发布安全补丁，建议升级到 5.43 及以上版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1269"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56.140","remediation":"建议立即升级 Info-ZIP UnZip 至 5.50 或更高版本（修复了绝对路径遍历漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可使用 `unzip -q` 参数或在受限目录下解压（如 `unzip -d /safe/dir archive.zip`）限制解压目录，避免使用 root 权限解压不可信压缩包。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:138 补丁包（unzip-5.50-3 及以上），Debian/Ubuntu 用户升级至 unzip 5.52 以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196445","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-47800-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1000928.1-1","http://www.info-zip.org/pub/infozip/UnZip.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1269.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1269","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1269.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1269.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mjxg-vj93-xfpq/GHSA-mjxg-vj93-xfpq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-138.nasl","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2001-1269","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1269.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-065.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1269.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0389.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0387","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0387.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1268","title":"Info-ZIP UnZip 目录遍历任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Info-ZIP UnZip 5.42 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可构造包含 \"..\" 路径序列的恶意压缩包，诱导用户解压时利用路径穿越跳出预期目录，覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞原理为解压过程未充分校验文件名路径，允许相对路径穿越。影响范围为所有使用受影响版本 UnZip 的系统，CVSS 2.1 分（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分完整性影响）。攻击条件要求受害者手动解压恶意压缩包，利用方式为通过精心设计的文件名实现任意文件写入，可能导致配置文件篡改、权限提升或植入后门。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1268"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56.023","remediation":"升级 Info-ZIP UnZip 至 6.0 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级，应仅解压受信任来源的 ZIP 文件，并使用 unzip 的 -d 参数指定安全的解压目录，避免使用相对路径包含 .. 的压缩包；同时可在脚本中预先检查压缩包内文件名，拒绝包含目录遍历字符的条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196445","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-47800-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1000928.1-1","http://www.info-zip.org/pub/infozip/UnZip.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1268","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9d50ef4048bfe5ac7cf90df5d14c2acad810c8d/2001/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b2e2a399e8a344ad8940a24e1493b2c5ab226ca4/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-12xx/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1268.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2001-1268"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0387.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0385","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0385.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1267","title":"GNU tar 目录遍历任意文件写入漏洞","description":"GNU tar 1.13.19 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可构造包含 \"..\" 路径遍历序列的恶意 tar 归档文件，诱导本地用户解压时触发路径遍历，导致任意文件被覆盖写入。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 tar 版本的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击条件为本地用户拥有解压 tar 文件权限且被诱导解压恶意构造的归档文件。攻击者通过在 tar 文件中嵌入包含目录遍历序列（如 \"../../etc/passwd\"）的文件名，在受害者解压时突破目录限制，覆盖系统关键文件导致权限提升或系统破坏。CVSS 2.1 分值（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/部分完整性影响），建议升级至 GNU tar 1.13.20 或更高版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1267"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:55.837","remediation":"立即升级 GNU tar 到 1.13.20 或更高版本（如 1.14+），该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。临时缓解：使用 --no-same-owner --no-same-permissions 选项解压，避免以 root 身份解压不可信 tar 包，或使用 --strip-components=1 剥离路径前缀防止目录遍历写入任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000538","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4514","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196445","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-47800-1","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10224.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:066","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-096.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-138.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-218.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3024","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2007/CVE-2007-4559.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1267.json","https://github.com/huggingface/datasets/blob/030a3e540e8e5cc850c01b0ea3bc0db448255567/src/datasets/utils/extract.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1267","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fbf5034ab66635f118016eef30012810a55b9a37/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1267.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/61e0472c274a1de596119dc07ee9549e09fe3313/2007/README.md","https://github.com/composefs/tar-rs/blob/2c19ee2fbd01a306127e027cb05a02568ccda1b3/src/entry.rs","https://github.com/allthemusicllc/atm-cli/blob/0f616f8559929a037693d3d6c3c36d8045d3aa11/docs/src/tar/entry.rs.html","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/926217721ffb9af6a599d252100d1345098455cb/gems/archive-tar-minitar/CVE-2016-10173.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1267.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0385.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0403","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1322","title":"xinetd 缺省umask设置不安全导致本地用户文件读写漏洞","description":"xinetd 2.1.8 及更早版本以默认 umask 0 运行，导致通过 xinetd 启动的应用程序在未自行设置安全 umask 的情况下创建的所有文件均具有过于宽松的权限（默认 0666）。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞读取或篡改由 xinetd 下运行的服务所产生的日志文件、临时文件或其他数据文件，造成敏感信息泄露或数据完整性破坏。该漏洞影响所有使用 xinetd 作为超级服务的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击条件为攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。Debian、Red Hat、Mandrake 等主流发行版均已发布安全公告并修复此问题，建议用户升级 xinetd 至最新版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1322"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02.487","remediation":"将 xinetd 升级到 2.1.8.8p3 或更高版本，该版本将默认 umask 值从 0 更改为安全的 022，防止由 xinetd 托管的应用程序在未自行设置 umask 时创建全局可读写的文件。对于无法立即升级的系统，可在 xinetd.conf 配置文件中通过 umask 指令显式设置 umask 为 022，或在受 xinetd 托管的应用程序启动脚本中通过 umask 命令设置安全权限掩码。同时建议检查 /tmp 等目录下是否存在由 SWAT 等工具创建的可被其他用户读取或修改的敏感文件，发现后立即删除并重新设置安全权限。Debian 用户应安装 xinetd_2.1.8.8.p3-1.1 安全更新包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000404","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-024-01","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-063","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6657.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-055.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1469.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-075.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2826","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2001/CVE-2001-1322.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1322.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1322","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/17761d0bb7d0c679e07e3a6bd812f9ec07c3dd92/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1322.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-063.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5m73-qfh8-jmx3/GHSA-5m73-qfh8-jmx3.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a62a80fdc2396b876bbf0b9654bdb65410ca206f/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1322.md","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-063.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-055.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0368","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1141","title":"SSLeay和OpenSSL 伪随机数生成器信息泄露漏洞","description":"SSLeay 和 OpenSSL 0.9.6b 之前的伪随机数生成器（PRNG）存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者可以通过获取其生成的小量伪随机数输出来推断 PRNG 的内部状态信息，进而预测未来生成的伪随机数序列。由于 SSL/TLS 协议严重依赖 PRNG 生成会话密钥、随机数等安全敏感数据，攻击者成功预测后可能导致加密通信被解密、数字签名被伪造或实施中间人攻击，从而泄露敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 SSLeay 和 OpenSSL 的应用与服务，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络中远程发起利用，OpenSSL 0.9.6b 版本已修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1141"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:39.927","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6b 或更高版本，替换受影响的 libcrypto 库文件；若系统存在静态链接该库的二进制文件，需重新编译这些程序。对于使用 pkgsrc 或发行版包管理的用户，安装 openssl-0.9.6b 或更新版本（如 NetBSD 的 openssl-0.9.6nb1）。升级后验证应用程序是否仍使用旧版库，必要时重启相关服务以加载新库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000418","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-065.php3?dis=8.0","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1483.html","http://www.osvdb.org/853","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-051.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3475","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/195829","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3004","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-1141.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d6b11572520f1521d4afb76db3052380c5ebc3d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1141","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-2001-1141.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/7ceeb61810e0d15a58a981a8bfda4eec6698f57d/references/CVE-2001-1141-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2001-1141__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/SSLeay%E5%92%8COpenSSL%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-1141).html","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1141.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a0be07a6da4cc5f35c33f97113080161927c2ef2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8mjq-7p84-m68q/GHSA-8mjq-7p84-m68q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1141.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0267","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0439","title":"licq URL shell元字符命令执行漏洞","description":"licq 是一款 Linux 平台下的 ICQ 即时通讯客户端软件，其 1.0.3 之前版本在处理 URL 时存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含 shell 元字符（如反引号、管道符等）的特制 URL 链接，当 licq 客户端解析并处理该恶意 URL 时，系统会执行嵌入的任意命令，导致攻击者能够在受害者主机上以 licq 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可造成信息泄露、系统控制等严重危害。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0439"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:18.700","remediation":"立即将 licq 升级到 1.0.3 或更高版本。各发行版对应操作：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2001-022 或 RHSA-2001-023 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-032 更新；Conectiva Linux 用户安装公告 000389 更新。如无法升级，可在 licq 配置中禁用 URL 自动解析功能，或在网络层面过滤包含 shell 元字符（如 `;` `|` `` ` `` `$`）的入站 URL 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-04/0607.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000389","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-032.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/5641","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-022.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-023.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0439.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0439","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0439.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0439.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8wfc-6m4r-hvmp/GHSA-8wfc-6m4r-hvmp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-032.nasl","https: