ain/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0177","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0177.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0432","title":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 远程管理服务 CGI 程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall for Linux 3.0.1 远程管理服务的多个 CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向受影响 CGI 程序发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而以服务进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响所有运行 Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 3.0.1 的 Linux 系统。目前已存在公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码，攻击者可轻易实施远程代码执行攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0432"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:17.930","remediation":"立即升级 Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 至 3.0.1 以上已修复版本；如无法升级，在防火墙上严格限制 TCP 端口 1812 的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员地址连接远程管理服务，并移除或禁用 /cgi-bin/ 目录下 catinfo 等 CGI 程序。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Trend Micro 当前支持的网关防病毒产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0218.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2579","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20750","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0432.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0432","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0432.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0432.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/vw_bof.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/interscan_vw_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0432.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2579/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0177.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0176","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0176.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0426","title":"Sun Solaris CDE dtsession 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0/8 及 SGI IRIX 6.5 操作系统的 CDE 桌面环境中的 dtsession 组件存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 LANG 环境变量传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于 dtsession 在处理环境变量时未正确检查边界，导致栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0426"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:17.250","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 针对 Solaris 7/8 发布的 CDE dtsession 补丁 (Patch ID 108650-xx 及后续更新)，SGI IRIX 6.5 用户应升级到安装了补丁的 IRIX 6.5.14 或更高版本。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod -s /usr/dt/bin/dtsession` 移除 dtsession 的 setuid 位，或限制可登录本地用户的白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0203.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20766","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0426","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0426.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0426.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7f96-32p